<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index drops 4.5 points to 900.5.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index drops 4.5 points to 900.5.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, dropped 4.5 points on Thursday to 900.5 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices fell, with the machinery index falling the most, down 18.9 points to 1,203.2.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
